# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Downloaded by tla/verify.sh
.tla-cache/
# Cloned by tools/a2a_tck.sh — the official A2A conformance kit and its venv
.tck-cache/
# TLC leaves these beside the specs it checks
tla/states/
tla/*.out

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Custom
.env
# The internal architecture constitution — never published, never packaged.
concepts/
# Backups written by tools/mutants.py while a mutation is applied. Present only
# between apply and revert; an interrupted sweep leaves one behind, and it must
# not be mistaken for source.
*.rs.orig

# Local agent tooling. The round skill encodes this project's own working
# procedure — how an item gets from open to discharged, how the gate is
# believed, how a mutation is written — and is useful, but it is workflow rather
# than product, and it reads `concepts/`, which is itself internal.
.claude/

# Python bytecode from tools/mutants.py.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
